# This repository holds SOURCE. Build output is produced from it and is not
# committed here by accident: a release archive carries the binaries.
#
# If a release does commit its exact binaries here, it adds them with
# `git add -f`, because they are ignored on purpose. That keeps the mistake
# safe: a stray build output never slips in, and a release that forgets a
# file shows up as a missing file.

# Papyrus output
*.pex
*.pex.tmp

# Native build
build/
out/
*.dll
*.pdb
*.lib
*.exp
*.ilk
vcpkg_installed/
.vs/
CMakeSettings.json
*.user

# Plugin data - distributed in the release archive
*.esp
*.esl
*.esm
*.bsa

# Editor and tool leftovers
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]*

# Local-only sources. Development tooling - probes, scratch instrumentation -
# compiles INTO the DLL, so it has to sit in the source tree; it must never
# enter this repository. It is kept outside and dropped in here to build. See
# the OPTIONAL include at the bottom of plugin-skse/CMakeLists.txt.
plugin-skse/src/_local/
